  { q: 'In an AVL tree, a node is unbalanced when its balance factor becomes:', opts: ['±1', '±2', '0', '±3 only'], a: 1, why: '−1, 0, and +1 are allowed. When an insertion makes a node reach +2 or −2, the tree must rotate.' },
